ocally derived fact. The author-written calculation policy cannot import it.\",\"locations\":[\"/inference/argument/0/text\",\"/inference/argument/0/uses\",\"/logic/calculations\"]},\"output\":{\"verdict\":\"UNVERIFIED\",\"notes\":\"The intended equality matches the target's form and the cases are stated, but the unsupported n=0 upper-bound step prevents deriving the full output.\",\"locations\":[\"/output/statement\",\"/inference/argument/0/text\",\"/inference/argument/2/text\"]},\"scope\":{\"verdict\":\"PASS\",\"notes\":\"The proof's arbitrary choices and case-local choices are described within the relevant argument sections; no witness escape is needed to identify the first failure. This does not validate the failed dimension inference.\",\"locations\":[\"/inference/locals\",\"/inference/argument\"]},\"applicability\":{\"verdict\":\"PASS\",\"notes\":\"On the supplied conditional source contracts, applications identify relevant bindings and obligations for the cited dimension, Hausdorff-measure, Lipschitz, integration, and measure inputs. This is not independent source verification and does not prove their results locally.\",\"locations\":[\"/inputs/2/source_contract\",\"/inputs/3/source_contract\",\"/inputs/4/source_contract\",\"/inputs/5/source_contract\",\"/inputs/6/source_contract\",\"/inputs/7/source_contract\",\"/inputs/8/source_contract\",\"/inputs/9/source_contract\",\"/inputs/10/source_contract\",\"/inputs/11/source_contract\",\"/inputs/12/source_contract\",\"/inputs/13/source_contract\",\"/inputs/14/source_contract\",\"/inference/applications\"]},\"statement_closure\":{\"verdict\":\"PASS\",\"notes\":\"Input and output statements are present in the packet, and the argument states its claimed estimates and case conclusions rather than relying on external equation numbers. The identified defect is an inference gap, not missing target text.\",\"locations\":[\"/inputs\",\"/output/statement\",\"/inference/argument\"]},\"object_closure\":{\"verdict\":\"UNVERIFIED\",\"notes\":\"The principal constructions and witnesses have stated local introductions. The prose uses many mathematical objects through inline descriptions, so inventories alone cannot resolve all occurrences. In particular, identifying the singleton does not establish the separate dimension claim.\",\"locations\":[\"/inference/locals\",\"/inference/argument/0/text\",\"/inference/argument/1/text\",\"/inference/argument/2/text\"]},\"dependency_closure\":{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"notes\":\"S001 uses the unproved singleton-dimension fact, absent from direct inputs and local derivations. Therefore actual factual dependency closure fails at this point.\",\"locations\":[\"/inference/argument/0/text\",\"/inference/argument/0/uses\",\"/inference/argument/0/produces\"]},\"packet_replay\":{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"notes\":\"Given the externally checked input/carrier boundary, this packet alone does not suffice: S001's n=0 inference to D=0 is unsupported. I read the complete packet and relevant rules; I do not certify execution isolation or runtime identity.\",\"locations\":[\"/inference/argument/0/text\",\"/logic/primitives/1\",\"/output/statement\"]}}}}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","d